   160	/**
   161	 * The design system is expressed twice: as Chakra values (`textStyles`) and as
   162	 * CSS custom properties behind global classes (`.zimm-text-*`). Both are ported
   163	 * from the same Handover source, so they must agree — but nothing structurally
   164	 * forces that, and a one-sided edit would silently split them.
   165	 *
   166	 * Each pair below maps a `textStyle` key to its `.zimm-text-*` class. The class
